        "warnings": "Contains distressing or potentially triggering themes",
        "fringe_first": null,
        "description": "A Uruguayan model. Diana Spencer. The Doors. Montevideo. The future as longing. Collapse as an inevitable destiny. 'Come on, baby, light my fire.' Between image, memory and fracture, Los A\u00f1os Maravillosos explores the distance between who we imagined we would become and who we were not. Through real archive, music and living presence, the performance moves between illusion and the wound of the real, confronting what remains when narratives we believed in fall apart. A theatrical experience about who we were, the future we imagined and the moment everything begins to collapse.",
        "description_teaser": null,
