        "warnings": "More information\nDiscussion of and reference to visual disability.",
        "fringe_first": null,
        "description": "Remember the rush of emotions as a teen, trying to transition into being an adult and finding your place in the world? Simon does. The joy of finding your favourite pop star as a teen and growing up with them means you always have their music to guide you. This charming funny show takes you through the highs and lows of Simon\u2019s life as he comes to term with being himself, learning about his visual disability and how to rebuild his life.",
