            "other_services_information": "Relaxed performances: 2026-08-08,2026-08-09,2026-08-10,2026-08-11,2026-08-12,2026-08-13,2026-08-14,2026-08-17,2026-08-18,2026-08-19,2026-08-20,2026-08-21,2026-08-24,2026-08-25,2026-08-26,2026-08-27,2026-08-28,2026-08-29,2026-08-30.\n\nThe show is very gentle. Lucy is neurodivergent and very understanding if people want to fidget, move around, or step out. Lucy is also open to some audience interaction, as long as it doesn't disrupt the stories too much. If you have a quick question you can call it out."
