        "description": "Hamlet\u2019s mom has got it going on... Claudius killed Hamlet's dad, married mum, and nicked the throne \u2013 what\u2019s an angsty royal teen to do? Find out, with a little help from Sinatra and Spears, the Killers and Kanye, ABBA, Gaga, Queen and Wicked. The world's greatest tragedy, retold through cleverly stupid parodies, riotous comedy and tatty cardboard props! Something is rockin\u2019 in the state of Denmark! Praise for previous shows: 'Laugh-out-loud' **** (BroadwayWorld.com). 'Psychotically upbeat' **** (TheWeeReview.com). 'Rip-roaring' (Everything-Theatre.co.uk). 'A raucous romp' **** (SpeakTheSpeech.blog).",
