        "description": "Through live music, storytelling, and extra cheese, pizza blogger Sean Taylor shares his quest for home \u2013 one slice at a time. Raised in a nomadic Mormon military family, Sean found stability in one unexpected constant: pizza. He explores how this universal comfort food became a way to survive everything from culture shock to loneliness, eventually leading him to improv comedy and his creation of 31daysofpizza.com, the world\u2019s longest-running pizza blog. Through humour and heart, audiences will see how this saucy obsession helped him create community, find love, and ultimately, a sense of belonging.",
